# Per-Dockerfile ignore list (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore before the root one).
# Upstream's root .dockerignore drops .git, libraries/, modules/, Tools/ ... — everything the
# commit image must carry — so mayhem/Dockerfile uses this list instead.

# ── Build outputs / local cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep build artifacts out of the context — the COPY boundary is what separates
# source from artifacts. build.sh produces its outputs under /mayhem at build time.
# Adjust the patterns per project.
build/
out/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
**/__pycache__/

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
